      alt="Official Steam header for Toto's Journey, a white and brown dog looking up at a pink butterfly beside the title"
      width="460"
      height="215"
    />
    <p class="kicker">404</p>
    <h1>That page is not in the guide.</h1>
    <p>This site covers the store overview, a pre-release walkthrough frame, the puzzle types official posts describe, and the items those posts name. It does not invent a missing route, and it does not host redeem codes.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="/guide">Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/walkthrough">Walkthrough</a></li>
      <li><a href="/puzzles">Puzzles</a></li>
      <li><a href="/collectibles">Collectibles</a></li>
      <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
    </ul>
